</span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV Theorems2.1.3.2–2.1.3.3, print240/PDF252"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source-statement-checked; complete ordinal reduction not reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NT}\">\\(\\mathsf{NT}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|\">\\(|\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fd52635f93837cdf\" href=\"?note=fd52635f93837cdf\" title=\"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_0\">\\(\\varepsilon_0\\)</span> 取同名定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathsf{NT}|=|\\mathsf{PA}|=\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(\\mathsf{NT},\\varepsilon_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathsf{NT}|=|\\mathsf{PA}|=\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(\\mathsf{NT},\\varepsilon_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源IV Theorems2.1.3.2–2.1.3.3，印刷p240/PDF252。下界由每个固定ε0初段上的带自由集参数归纳可证性；上界由无穷演算嵌入、消割与有界性论证。原文定理读作NT而非将所有集合的语义量化混入PA对象公式。已核对定理及上下界主链，尚未在笔记完整重建这些归约。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-ordinal-analysis","status":"resolved","id":"de8a2a5170e43df9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-ordinal-analysis]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0","status":"resolved","id":"446dc4361d624e0f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NT}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]，$|\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|$ 取 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]。$\\varepsilon_0$ 取同名定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"fd52635f93837cdf","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NT}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]，$|\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|$ 取 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]。$\\varepsilon_0$ 取同名定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{NT}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_0","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathsf{NT}|=|\\mathsf{PA}|=\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad\\operatorname{OrdAnalysis}(\\mathsf{NT},\\varepsilon_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1358,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-ordinal-analysis-pa|thm-ordinal-analysis-pa — Ordinal Analysis of PA]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"coun